# Baron Strucker, HYDRA Overlord: "Do this only once each turn" (CR 603.2h): "This ability triggers only if its source's
# controller has not yet taken the indicated action that turn" - the controller now. On turn 3 Bot1's Agents of HYDRA
# connives (Island discarded), then Bot1 gives Baron Strucker to Bot2 with Harmless Offering. Bot2 flashes in Swarm, Being
# of Bees that same turn ({1}{B}: Baron's discount is Bot2's now): Bot2 has not connived with it, so it triggers for Bot2,
# whose Swarm connives (a Swamp discarded, no counter).

